{{{strategy discussion that could contain spoilers}}}


save the wands of polymorph! in a pinch you could zap yourself,
polymorphing into a blobbish monster and the boots would fall off, but
let's not be hasty. you can go upstairs, so float over to the backdoor
(apparently the way you got in) and then float around the moat to the
front side (be careful of eels!). you'll find the up stairwell. float up
and find a sink, magic trap, succubus or nymph. some other alternatives
are try a prayer (before you get hungry) or chance a curse spell from a
curse casting monster. sometimes they get things wrong and uncurse
cursed items ...

about the drawbridge, you don't need to get it down but if you must,
then try a wand of opening, a spell of knock or play the right tune
with a musical instrument. don't improvise and listen for the clues so
you can figure out the tune.
